    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "0c517191aaf93e5ee34d": "My axe has seen many battles, and I like to keep it handy. Enemy forces have fought their way into our capital several times now, but have no fear: we have always driven them back.",
        "7378b89f7308dd04e277": "Train me.",
        "b1d226a45eb343da3f90": "Your skills are insufficient to learn what I teach. Try talking to Mak over there instead. He can help you out until you're ready for more advanced lessons.",
        "f8584e550f3265688101": "I cannot help you with further training: your skill at working with leather rivals my own. You should speak with Una, over there. I will vouch for your skill if need be.",
        "fbadd870b6d9e9285bfc": "I am pleased with your progress so far. Surely the Earth Mother has inspired your hands."
      },
      "name": "Tarn",
      "subName": "Expert Leatherworker",
      "translationMetadata": {
